# Allowlist: the image build needs only the Go module, its sources and the
# migrations. Everything else (docs, web site, scripts, local .env files,
# test fixtures) stays out of the build context so it can neither leak into
# the builder stage nor invalidate the build cache.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!main.go
!cmd/
!internal/
!migrations/
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
